# Endospore default home -- page-2 (screen 1) apps, seeded into a FRESH roamed profile's launcher.db by
# nowhere_roamd.sh seed_home() (E.5d, DIA-20260710). WHY a seed and not just the launcher overlay: the
# GrapheneOS/AOSP Launcher3 default-layout importer only imports the DOCK (hotseat) from default_workspace;
# it silently drops multi-screen DESKTOP items (proven on lynx -- LineageOS/Trebuchet on the FP3 imports both,
# so the FP3 needs no seed and this file is Endospore-only). So the empty landing + dock come from the
# launcher overlay (default_workspace_5x5.xml) and these page-2 apps are injected after the first login.
#
# Format: screen|cellX|cellY|packageName|className   (container = desktop, itemType = app; '#' = comment).
# Layout mirrors the FP3 two-page home (editions/diaspore/devices/fp3/.../default_workspace_5x5.xml); the
# browser (Vanadium) and camera (GrapheneOS Camera) edition swaps live in the dock, not this page.
#
# Row 0: maps / weather / comms / media
1|0|0|app.organicmaps|app.organicmaps.DownloadResourcesActivity
1|1|0|org.breezyweather|org.breezyweather.ui.main.MainActivity
1|2|0|eu.siacs.conversations|eu.siacs.conversations.ui.ConversationActivity
1|3|0|org.schabi.newpipe|org.schabi.newpipe.MainActivity
1|4|0|de.danoeh.antennapod|de.danoeh.antennapod.activity.SplashActivity
